  "goodToKnow": "Das Marihuana is marijuana, dried cannabis flowers; slang words include Gras. Since April 2024, Germany's Cannabisgesetz has allowed adults to possess limited amounts, grow up to three plants at home, and join non-profit Anbauvereinigungen (growing associations). Commercial sale remains illegal, and use near schools and in front of minors is banned. Medical cannabis has been available on prescription since 2017. It has no plural."
